lized to the lysosome and activated. The KICSTOR complex is also probably involved in the regulation of mTORC1 by glucose."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}